SUMMARY:Grant deadline: Oregon Capacity Building & Community Grant Progra
 m (Land Trust Alliance)
DESCRIPTION:Funder: Land Trust Alliance / Coalition of Oregon Land Trusts
  / Oregon Community Foundation\nAmount: $15\,000 – $35\,000 (program a
 wards up to $560\,000 total)\nStatus: Closing now / annual\nFit: High 
 – directly aimed at Oregon land trusts for capacity building and commu
 nity engagement.\n\nDeadline detail: Applications accepted through June 
 26\, 2026. Notifications by Sept 11\, 2026. Grant period Oct 1\, 2026 
 – Dec 1\, 2027.\n\nEligibility: Oregon land trusts. 2025 recipients ar
 e still eligible to reapply.\n\nApply: https://landtrustalliance.org/res
 ources/connect/field-services/west/oregon-community-and-capacity-buildin
 g-grant-program
