SUMMARY:Grant deadline: Fall Community Grants Cycle (Oregon Community Fou
 ndation (OCF))
DESCRIPTION:Funder: Oregon Community Foundation (OCF)\nAmount: Program & 
 project grants\, capacity building\, small capital under $500k\nStatus: 
 Upcoming – verify exact date\nFit: High – OCF funds pressing communi
 ty needs statewide including housing and capacity building.\n\nDeadline 
 detail: Fall 2026 cycle. New applicants must create a Nonprofit Account 
 well in advance (prior cycle required setup ~weeks ahead). Confirm exact
  deadline on MyOCF portal.\n\nEligibility: Oregon 501(c)(3) nonprofits. 
 First-time applicants must set up a MyOCF Nonprofit Account before apply
 ing.\n\nApply: https://oregoncf.org/grants-and-scholarships/grants/commu
 nity-grant-program
