 ating support (Meyer distributes $30M+/yr)\nStatus: Verify current windo
 w\nFit: Very High – Meyer explicitly funds affordable housing producti
 on\, preservation\, policy\, and prioritizes BIPOC-led / BIPOC-serving o
 rganizations.\n\nDeadline detail: Rolling/invitation and cyclical fundin
 g windows. Confirm current open call on Meyer's site\; timing varies yea
 r to year.\n\nEligibility: Oregon nonprofits\; prioritizes organizations
  led by or serving communities most impacted by systemic inequity.\n\nAp
 ply: https://mmt.org/
