SUMMARY:Grant deadline: Competitive Affordable Housing Program (AHP) (Fed
 eral Home Loan Bank of Des Moines)
DESCRIPTION:Funder: Federal Home Loan Bank of Des Moines\nAmount: Up to $
 3\,000\,000 per project ($150\,000 max subsidy per unit)\nStatus: Next r
 ound ~April 2027\nFit: Very High – one of the nation's largest sources
  of affordable housing project grants\; covers purchase\, construction\,
  and rehab of homeownership units.\n\nDeadline detail: 2026 round closed
  May 1\, 2026 (awards announced Dec 2026). 2027 round expected to open ~
 April 1\, 2027. Requires partnership with an FHLB member bank.\n\nEligib
 ility: Nonprofit sponsors must partner with an FHLB Des Moines member fi
 nancial institution to apply.\n\nApply: https://www.fhlbdm.com/products-
 services/affordable-housing/ahp-sponsors/
URL:https://www.fhlbdm.com/products-services/affordable-housing/ahp-spons
 ors/
