SUMMARY:Grant deadline: Housing Affordability Breakthrough Challenge (Wel
 ls Fargo)
DESCRIPTION:Funder: Wells Fargo / Enterprise Community Partners\nAmount: 
 $2\,000\,000 each to five winning organizations\nStatus: Next cycle ~spr
 ing 2027\nFit: Medium-High – rewards scalable\, innovative housing sol
 utions\; the CLT shared-equity model could qualify under Finance or Serv
 ice & Delivery.\n\nDeadline detail: 2026 cycle ran April 1 – May 15\, 
 2026 (closed). Next cycle expected ~spring 2027. Three-round competition
 .\n\nEligibility: Nonprofit and for-profit orgs with demonstrated early 
 results and a strategy to scale. Priority scoring for organizations in s
 elect states.\n\nApply: https://www.enterprisecommunity.org/housing-affo
 rdability-breakthrough-challenge/national-grant-competition
URL:https://www.enterprisecommunity.org/housing-affordability-breakthroug
 h-challenge/national-grant-competition
