SUMMARY:Grant deadline: Neighborhood Builders® (Bank of America Charitab
 le Foundation)
DESCRIPTION:Funder: Bank of America Charitable Foundation\nAmount: $100\,
 000 – $400\,000 over two years (capped at 10% of annual revenue)\nStat
 us: Annual – next ~June 2027\nFit: High – explicitly funds creation/
 preservation of affordable housing and homeownership opportunities\, plu
 s leadership development.\n\nDeadline detail: 2026 application window wa
 s June 1 – July 1\, 2026. Recurs annually around the same window. Conf
 irm your local market is selected.\n\nEligibility: 501(c)(3) nonprofits 
 in selected markets. Cannot have received Neighborhood Builders/Champion
 s funding since Oct 2019. Grant capped at 10% of most recent annual reve
 nue.\n\nApply: https://about.bankofamerica.com/en/making-an-impact/neigh
 borhood-builders-eligibility-criteria
URL:https://about.bankofamerica.com/en/making-an-impact/neighborhood-buil
 ders-eligibility-criteria
