SUMMARY:Grant deadline: Housing Development Grant Program (HDGP / Trust F
 und) (Oregon Housing and Community Services (OHCS))
DESCRIPTION:Funder: Oregon Housing and Community Services (OHCS)\nAmount:
  Varies by NOFA round\nStatus: Monitor for next NOFA\nFit: Medium – HD
 GP centers on multifamily/rental\, but OHCS administers multiple homeown
 ership and development resources worth tracking.\n\nDeadline detail: Awa
 rded via competitive Notice of Funding Availability (NOFA) rounds announ
 ced periodically. Monitor OHCS for the next NOFA.\n\nEligibility: Nonpro
 fit housing developers\, local housing authorities\, Tribal housing enti
 ties\, and for/nonprofit sponsors depending on program.\n\nApply: https:
 //www.oregon.gov/ohcs/development/pages/grants-tax-credit-programs.aspx
URL:https://www.oregon.gov/ohcs/development/pages/grants-tax-credit-progr
 ams.aspx
