SUMMARY:Grant deadline: Strategic Projects: Program & Staff / Equipment &
  Technology Grants (M.J. Murdock Charitable Trust)
DESCRIPTION:Funder: M.J. Murdock Charitable Trust\nAmount: Capacity-build
 ing grants\; recipient cofunds at least 50% of costs\nStatus: Rolling in
 quiry\nFit: Medium-High – PNW-focused funder of 501(c)(3) capacity bui
 lding\; values diversified funding and community flourishing.\n\nDeadlin
 e detail: Rolling consideration\; Murdock uses an inquiry-then-proposal 
 process. Confirm current process on Murdock's site.\n\nEligibility: 501(
 c)(3) nonprofits and tribal entities in the Pacific Northwest. Requires 
 recipient to cover at least 50% of project costs.\n\nApply: https://murd
 ocktrust.org/
